WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.940
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs

01:35.040 --> 01:39.950
Episode 2:
Goodbye Mother

02:03.250 --> 02:04.020
A dream?

02:14.320 --> 02:18.700
Damn!
I will be unable to work like this.

02:18.720 --> 02:21.660
My life has been ruined!

02:22.510 --> 02:23.160
Who's there?

02:25.070 --> 02:26.290
Good morning, father.

02:28.610 --> 02:29.880
How long were you there?

02:32.010 --> 02:32.630
Go.

02:35.010 --> 02:36.260
Okay.

02:38.560 --> 02:40.210
Hurry up!

02:44.020 --> 02:46.350
Sis...

02:49.820 --> 02:52.820
Yesterday you were very mean to my sister.

02:54.160 --> 02:55.820
Remy doesn't belong in this family.

02:56.060 --> 02:58.420
My sister does belong in this family!

02:58.720 --> 02:59.570
Don't you understand?

03:00.230 --> 03:03.700
We don't have enough money to keep Remy!

03:15.390 --> 03:16.670
Remy.

03:23.020 --> 03:24.920
Mother!

03:31.040 --> 03:33.900
Remy...
Don't cry.

03:35.100 --> 03:37.060
I'm not crying.

03:43.350 --> 03:49.250
Your father has changed a lot.
Those injuries have changed him.

03:49.930 --> 03:51.130
Mother.

03:52.900 --> 03:54.250
Was I really a foundling?

03:54.730 --> 03:56.830
Am I not your child?

03:57.250 --> 03:58.270
Remy...

04:00.450 --> 04:05.930
I've prayed to God for years...
...for this moment never to come.

04:07.030 --> 04:10.930
But it's about time that you knew the whole truth.

04:13.930 --> 04:18.630
Ten years ago your father was working in Paris.

04:20.030 --> 04:24.450
One day, when he was returning from work...

04:36.400 --> 04:40.680
...he saw a baby in the street wearing beautiful clothes.

04:40.780 --> 04:46.140
Your father knew the baby must belong to a wealthy family.

04:47.190 --> 04:50.480
The police did everything possible to find the baby's family.

04:50.500 --> 04:52.900
Even your father went around asking.

04:53.800 --> 04:57.400
But they couldn't find out anything.

04:58.140 --> 05:01.980
So your father brought you home.

05:04.220 --> 05:09.910
At that time I was depressed, after loosing our own baby to an illness...

05:10.400 --> 05:14.960
and when I saw you, Remy, I thought it was a gift from God.

05:15.580 --> 05:20.240
Every time you smiled I felt the sun shine in my heart.

05:24.340 --> 05:29.470
I never stopped thinking...
that you were my daughter.

05:30.940 --> 05:32.140
Mother...

05:40.450 --> 05:42.240
Stop all that crying.

05:44.850 --> 05:47.150
I wasn't crying!

05:52.090 --> 05:57.850
Father, I can help by working at Mr. Lacontte's store...

05:57.950 --> 06:02.840
...and doing the laundry, washing the dishes, whatever I can do to help.

06:05.550 --> 06:07.250
Fine. Come on!

06:08.550 --> 06:09.650
Dear!

06:09.930 --> 06:11.430
Be silent!

06:12.150 --> 06:13.650
Mother!

06:22.950 --> 06:24.360
Remy...

06:30.410 --> 06:32.860
Wait here. Understand?

06:42.060 --> 06:46.130
Jerome, we heard about your accident.
How are your wounds?

06:46.860 --> 06:48.830
What will you do now?

06:49.560 --> 06:52.140
Do you know if Pollinel came today?

06:52.690 --> 06:54.140
Pollinel...?

07:10.140 --> 07:13.960
Everything will be fine.
Surely!

07:19.060 --> 07:20.690
I remember you from yesterday.

07:22.560 --> 07:23.500
Good morning.

07:24.360 --> 07:26.230
Where are the other dogs?

07:29.660 --> 07:34.270
Who put these bottles here?
I didn't leave them out!

07:38.460 --> 07:39.390
Sir!

07:39.490 --> 07:40.770
What do you want?

07:41.540 --> 07:44.640
You broke those wine bottles and you didn't even think to pay for them?

07:44.920 --> 07:45.920
What?

07:46.070 --> 07:48.080
That's practically stealing!

07:48.190 --> 07:49.840
Go away!

07:57.650 --> 07:58.450
Go away!

08:01.210 --> 08:02.470
Shut up!

08:04.070 --> 08:05.850
Stop it! Stop it!

08:06.070 --> 08:07.670
What's going on?

08:07.700 --> 08:08.750
What's happening?

08:13.080 --> 08:15.380
What's all the fuss?

08:16.080 --> 08:17.480
Who did this?

08:17.530 --> 08:23.560
That dog. Not only did it break the bottles but it attempted to bite too.

08:23.780 --> 08:25.240
Is that true, Remy?

08:26.470 --> 08:27.150
It's a lie!

08:27.590 --> 08:29.720
It's a vicious dog.

08:29.860 --> 08:31.400
Wrong! That's wrong!

08:32.360 --> 08:36.180
This dog didn't do anything!
That man broke the bottles.

08:36.190 --> 08:38.450
Remy is not one to lie.

08:39.900 --> 08:42.460
You're going to believe a brat like that?

08:42.470 --> 08:44.740
I'm telling you the dog did it.

08:45.150 --> 08:48.510
That dog is one of my actors.

08:50.130 --> 08:54.210
And I can prove if it's a vicious dog or not.

08:55.590 --> 08:58.400
And how are you going to prove it?

08:58.570 --> 09:00.680
You'll see in a moment.

09:02.790 --> 09:03.690
Joli-Coeur!

09:12.230 --> 09:13.840
It's a monkey.
- That's right.

09:15.240 --> 09:18.110
I want you to play the role of a thief.

09:19.510 --> 09:21.540
Go and steal something.

09:27.800 --> 09:28.840
What are you doing?

09:35.020 --> 09:36.550
You little!

09:40.000 --> 09:42.800
Police! Arrest the thief!

10:08.130 --> 10:09.590
Don't you want it?

10:19.180 --> 10:20.880
I want you to say sorry.

10:26.380 --> 10:27.320
He's incredible!

10:27.890 --> 10:31.830
They're so smart.
How was he able to teach them that?

10:32.220 --> 10:36.440
Are you still going to say that it's a vicious dog?

10:37.520 --> 10:38.540
No.

10:38.670 --> 10:41.650
Now you know who broke the bottles.

10:44.300 --> 10:46.290
Isn't this the man who buys and sells children?

10:46.370 --> 10:50.360
Yes, it's Pollinel.
He's got a bad reputation.

10:51.120 --> 10:56.050
I'm leaving! I can't stand these people.

10:56.720 --> 10:58.520
Hope they're satisfied.

11:14.950 --> 11:17.620
What a day!

11:20.750 --> 11:21.750
Who's there?

11:23.360 --> 11:25.240
I want to sell a child.

11:27.620 --> 11:33.060
A ten year old girl.
How much would you give for her?

11:35.300 --> 11:36.800
20 francs.

11:47.030 --> 11:50.690
They're amazing, they can do a lot of things.

11:52.930 --> 11:56.950
That's how we make our living in many different countries.

11:57.380 --> 11:59.450
We're a traveling troupe.

11:59.980 --> 12:02.920
You're all part of a traveling troupe?

12:03.910 --> 12:05.950
Yes, we're the Vitalis troupe.

12:06.910 --> 12:08.480
The Vitalis troupe?

12:08.790 --> 12:11.710
Joli-Coeur, say hello!

12:20.140 --> 12:22.140
Joli-Coeur, you're amazing!

12:25.630 --> 12:29.710
This is Zerbino, he really likes to play.

12:30.190 --> 12:31.560
Hello, Zerbino!

12:31.720 --> 12:35.190
Zerbino means elegant in Italian.

12:36.100 --> 12:40.700
This is Dolce, that means gentle in Italian.

12:41.180 --> 12:42.270
Ah, so you're Dolce.

12:50.070 --> 12:56.160
The last one is Capi which comes from capitano in Italian, that means captain.

13:01.660 --> 13:02.950
Nice to meet you, Capi.

13:05.660 --> 13:10.310
It must be a lot of fun to travel to many countries with everyone.

13:11.030 --> 13:12.310
No.

13:13.280 --> 13:15.490
It isn't always fun.

13:18.430 --> 13:21.700
Always going from one place to another,

13:21.880 --> 13:23.820
we meet many people but must leave the next day.

13:24.250 --> 13:27.830
We cannot get attached to anyone because we have to say goodbye.

13:28.330 --> 13:30.350
That's our life.

13:37.820 --> 13:44.090
Mr. Vitalis, you know, I was abandoned as a baby.

13:51.130 --> 13:52.640
Is that so?

14:00.460 --> 14:01.790
Father.

14:05.980 --> 14:08.120
Oh, this kid.

14:10.310 --> 14:13.490
Remy, I want you to go with this man.

14:16.030 --> 14:17.640
Prepare yourself.

14:18.030 --> 14:21.510
You'll never see this disgusting village again.

14:24.580 --> 14:25.760
Father!

14:27.260 --> 14:29.260
This is none of your business.

14:29.560 --> 14:31.790
Father, what's going on?

14:31.820 --> 14:33.350
Come with me, hurry.

14:33.540 --> 14:34.580
Father!

14:37.490 --> 14:38.730
Father!

14:39.020 --> 14:41.000
Father!

14:45.310 --> 14:48.200
We'll leave at nightfall. Stay here until dark.

14:48.400 --> 14:51.420
And don't even think of escaping.

15:07.200 --> 15:10.990
Help! Help mother!

15:11.510 --> 15:13.280
Mother!

15:14.530 --> 15:17.050
Tell me. What have you done with Remy?

15:19.970 --> 15:22.500
With this money we can last for a while.

15:22.850 --> 15:25.430
Before it runs out I'll find work.

15:26.440 --> 15:28.210
How could you...?

15:29.480 --> 15:29.990
Remy!

15:32.920 --> 15:34.000
Remy!

15:34.200 --> 15:35.000
Remy!

15:37.310 --> 15:38.720
What's wrong, mother?

15:39.170 --> 15:40.090
Mother!

15:43.160 --> 15:43.670
Remy!

15:43.930 --> 15:44.510
Remy!

15:47.160 --> 15:48.030
All right. Go!

16:05.960 --> 16:07.460
I want to talk to you.

16:08.110 --> 16:09.500
Go away, I'm eating.

16:10.860 --> 16:12.660
What are you going to do with that girl?

16:13.910 --> 16:16.420
I can easily sell her in Paris.

16:16.640 --> 16:19.880
And she'll work there for the rest of her life.

16:26.250 --> 16:27.670
Well then, I'll buy her.

16:29.370 --> 16:33.350
She can sing very well. She'd be a great addition to my troupe.

16:33.550 --> 16:36.500
Very well, she's yours for 100 francs.

16:36.620 --> 16:37.510
80!

16:37.790 --> 16:39.600
I said a hundred.

16:40.850 --> 16:41.850
Agreed.

16:45.640 --> 16:47.900
Wait, there's only 20 here.

16:48.530 --> 16:51.810
That's only an advance payment. I'm going to get the rest.

16:56.260 --> 16:59.140
100 francs! What a deal!

17:11.600 --> 17:15.140
I'll never see my mother again!

17:20.460 --> 17:22.000
Nana, look over there.

17:22.080 --> 17:22.870
Okay.

17:23.760 --> 17:24.650
Remy.

17:31.030 --> 17:32.480
Joli-Coeur!

17:43.740 --> 17:45.110
Mr. Vitalis!

17:46.860 --> 17:47.580
Dolce.

17:48.980 --> 17:50.590
Come! We have to get out of here.

17:52.240 --> 17:53.300
Quickly.

17:56.550 --> 17:58.700
It was a really fun performance.

18:02.670 --> 18:03.310
Remy...

18:07.430 --> 18:09.510
Slow old man...

18:16.140 --> 18:17.110
Welcome.

18:17.630 --> 18:18.240
Say...

18:19.080 --> 18:24.280
I just saw Remy. She was in the wagon of the man and his dogs from this morning.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.920
What could they be doing?

18:29.350 --> 18:31.630
That bastard tricked me!

18:36.440 --> 18:38.640
Going with you, Mr. Vitalis?

18:39.150 --> 18:43.320
Yes, I think it would be much better for you to go with me.

18:45.450 --> 18:49.470
But my father told me to go with...

18:50.590 --> 18:52.150
You'll have to make a decision.

19:01.950 --> 19:04.540
I will be scolded unless I go with him.

19:11.550 --> 19:13.590
Damn! Where did he go!?

19:13.850 --> 19:15.950
That guy... He will not get away.

19:18.950 --> 19:20.200
Move!

19:29.090 --> 19:32.440
Remy, Remy, my Remy.

19:39.480 --> 19:44.520
Remy, if you come with me, know that it will be a long journey.

19:45.400 --> 19:48.070
You may never see your mother again.

19:48.650 --> 19:50.930
But you must come with me.

19:51.470 --> 19:52.380
Why?

19:54.700 --> 19:57.510
Because if you don't, you'll bring sadness to someone else.

19:58.120 --> 19:59.430
Your mother.

20:00.950 --> 20:01.620
That's not true.

20:03.980 --> 20:06.930
If you think that, then stay here and you'll see.

20:18.670 --> 20:19.560
Mother.

20:23.000 --> 20:24.080
Mother!

20:25.030 --> 20:26.520
Mother!

20:27.280 --> 20:28.840
Mother!

20:29.240 --> 20:33.130
I'm here, mother!

20:53.020 --> 20:54.060
Mother...

20:55.040 --> 20:55.830
I...

20:58.030 --> 20:58.710
I...

20:59.810 --> 21:00.980
Mother...

21:02.690 --> 21:04.280
I can't make you sad.

21:05.730 --> 21:07.420
Wait! Wait!

21:08.170 --> 21:09.240
Take me with you!

21:10.600 --> 21:11.920
I'll go with you.

21:12.000 --> 21:14.540
Take me with you, Mr. Vitalis.

21:17.920 --> 21:21.010
Well, let's go. Go forward!

21:22.440 --> 21:31.730
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

21:32.240 --> 21:42.080
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

21:33.390 --> 21:34.230
Goodbye.

21:37.490 --> 21:38.720
Goodbye.

21:39.440 --> 21:41.680
Goodbye!

21:42.150 --> 21:45.630
Mother!

21:43.580 --> 21:53.450
Tomorrow's courage comes

21:53.650 --> 22:03.250
From the future that gives us our fate

22:03.450 --> 22:12.230
Try to seek for them more

22:12.950 --> 22:16.780
Give your heart to

22:16.950 --> 22:28.940
That person who is also seeking you

22:29.250 --> 22:39.150
Tomorrow promises that

22:39.350 --> 22:48.950
There will always be mistakes but

22:49.150 --> 22:57.250
Try to seek for them more

22:58.650 --> 23:02.550
Give your heart to

23:02.650 --> 23:16.760
That person who is also seeking you

23:19.730 --> 23:25.130
I've decided to perform with the Vitalis troupe as one of its members.

23:25.330 --> 23:28.090
I cannot be crying any longer.

23:28.300 --> 23:31.820
But the money we'd made was stolen.

23:32.350 --> 23:35.940
Please look forward to it!

23:32.350 --> 23:35.940
<i>Vitalis Troupe</i>

23:32.350 --> 23:35.940
Next time:
